                            <div                 class="card bg-dark_2 border h-100 text-left br-8 text-md-left img_top p-3 d-flex flex-column">
                <div class="card__content d-flex flex-column h-100 "><h2 class="h5 color-white m-0">Proxy Networks Pricing</h2><div class="body color-white_200"><p class="pt-1 pb-3">Elevate your business with our top-tier proxy services.</p>
<ul class="ticked small dark secondary_1">
<li>Largest Geographic Coverage</li>
<li>Battle-Tested Stability & Speeds</li>
<li>400M+ monthly Residential IPs</li>
</ul>
</div><div class="mt-auto d-flex pt-lg-0"><a href="/pricing/proxy-network" class="btn btn--brand btn--small with_borders btn--capsule px-6 mx-auto mt-2" title="See Pricing" target="_self"><span>See Pricing</span><svg class="cta_ic " width="10" height="10"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10">
          <g fill-rule="evenodd"><path class="cta_ic-line_path" d="M0 5h7">
            </path><path class="cta_ic-tip_path" d="M1 1l4 4-4 4"></path></g>
        </svg></a></div></div>              </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="card_wrapper card_wrapper col-12 col-md-6 mb-1 mb-md-2 mb-xl-4 col-lg-4">
                            <div                 class="card bg-dark_2 border h-100 text-left br-8 text-md-left img_top p-3 d-flex flex-column">
                <div class="card__content d-flex flex-column h-100 "><h2 class="h5 color-white m-0">Web Scraper API Pricing</h2><div class="body color-white_200"><p class="pt-1 pb-3">Easily extract web data with our powerful Web Scraper API.</p>
<ul class="ticked small dark secondary_1">
<li>Pre-built scraper APIs</li>
<li>IP rotation & CAPTCHA handling</li>
<li>Scalable infrastructure support</li>
</ul></div><div class="mt-auto d-flex pt-lg-0"><a href="/pricing/web-scraper" class="btn btn--brand btn--small with_borders btn--capsule px-6 mx-auto mt-2" title="See Pricing" target="_self"><span>See Pricing</span><svg class="cta_ic " width="10" height="10"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10">
          <g fill-rule="evenodd"><path class="cta_ic-line_path" d="M0 5h7">
            </path><path class="cta_ic-tip_path" d="M1 1l4 4-4 4"></path></g>
        </svg></a></div></div>              </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="card_wrapper card_wrapper col-12 col-md-6 mb-1 mb-md-2 mb-xl-4 col-lg-4">
                            <div                 class="card bg-dark_2 border h-100 text-left br-8 text-md-left img_top p-3 d-flex flex-column">
                <div class="card__content d-flex flex-column h-100 "><h2 class="h5 color-white m-0">Scraper Studio Pricing</h2><div class="body color-white_200"><p class="pt-1 pb-3">Launch AI-powered scrapers for any website in minutes.</p>
<ul class="ticked small dark secondary_1">
<li>Collect data from any website</li>
<li>Only pay for successful requets</li>
<li>Free tier pricing available</li>
</ul>
</div><div class="mt-auto d-flex pt-lg-0"><a href="/pricing/web-scraper/studio" class="btn btn--brand btn--small with_borders btn--capsule px-6 mx-auto mt-2" title="See Pricing" target="_self"><span>See Pricing</span><svg class="cta_ic " width="10" height="10"
