        </svg></a></div></div>              </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="card_wrapper card_wrapper col-12 col-md-6 mb-1 mb-md-2 mb-xl-4 col-lg-4">
                            <div                 class="card bg-dark_2 border h-100 text-left br-8 text-md-left img_top p-3 d-flex flex-column">
                <div class="card__content d-flex flex-column h-100 "><h2 class="h5 color-white m-0">Scraping Browser Pricing</h2><div class="body color-white_200"><p class="pt-1 pb-3">Access our Scraping Browser, compatible with leading web automation tools.</p>
<ul class="ticked small dark secondary_1">
<li>Built-In Website Unlocking</li>
