                <div class="card__content d-flex flex-column h-100 "><h2 class="h5 color-white m-0">SERP API Pricing</h2><div class="body color-white_200"><p class="pt-1 pb-3">Access our powerful SERP API to retrieve live data from any search engine.</p>
<ul class="ticked small dark secondary_1">
<li>Data Delivered in JSON or HTML</li>
<li>Save Time & Resources</li>
<li>Search Multiple Search Engines</li>
